{"id":"235651614fd28cce","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-pi1-incompleteness.md","title":"Pi 1 Incompleteness","display":"thm-pi1-incompleteness — Pi_1 Incompleteness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-pi1-incompleteness","aliases":["92-thm-pi1-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-pi1-incompleteness — Pi_1 Incompleteness","depends_on":["[[92-df-pi1-formula]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-standard-model]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-delta0-formula]]","[[92-fact-godel-sentence-pi1]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-pi1-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-pi1-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pi1-incompleteness — Pi_1 Incompleteness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140342deea557884\" href=\"?note=140342deea557884\" title=\"92-df-pi1-formula\">92-df-pi1-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d754a154b50a9533\" href=\"?note=d754a154b50a9533\" title=\"92-df-delta0-formula\">92-df-delta0-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b0cf42030c298d08\" href=\"?note=b0cf42030c298d08\" title=\"92-fact-godel-sentence-pi1\">92-fact-godel-sentence-pi1</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (consistency, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^G\">\\(\\Pi_1^G\\)</span> (first universal arithmetical level)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span> (standard arithmetic structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (effectivity and arithmetic-strength conditions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\\)</span> (bounded internal representation of the proof relation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pi1\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Pi_1^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\varphi\\land G\\nvdash\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pi1\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Pi_1^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\varphi\\land G\\nvdash\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>不完备性：存在真<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>句子不可证</li>\n<li>Gödel句子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_G \\in \\Pi_1\">\\(\\varphi_G \\in \\Pi_1\\)</span>是真但不可证的</li>\n<li>对标准证明公式，内部一致性句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>也是一个可用的真而不可证的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>例子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>完备 + <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>不完备</li>\n<li>这是不完备性的层级视角</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>真且<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>只说明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>是假的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>句；要由此推出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi\">\\(G\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>还需<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>一致性或<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>可靠性，普通一致性不足</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-pi1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"140342deea557884","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-pi1-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-standard-model","status":"resolved","id":"ccb738ae4bbf923c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-standard-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-elementary-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-a